/* CodeBurn Menubar (Windows tray) — 简体中文 (zh-Hans).
 *
 * Keys are the English development copy; see en.lproj/Localizable.strings for
 * the conventions. Format specifiers (%@, %lld, %%%%) must stay identical to the
 * English entry, in the same order — the coverage test in
 * src-tauri/src/i18n.rs fails the build otherwise, because a mismatch is a
 * wrong number at runtime.
 *
 * Seeded verbatim from the macOS menubar's reviewed table
 * (mac/Sources/CodeBurnMenubar/Resources/zh-Hans.lproj/Localizable.strings):
 * a sentence both apps render is translated once, identically, on both
 * platforms. The sections at the end hold the strings only the Windows tray
 * renders, translated with the same terminology.
 *
 * Untranslated on purpose: provider, model and plan names (Claude, Codex,
 * Gemini, Opus, Sonnet, Antigravity…), units, currency codes, shell commands
 * and file paths, and anything the `codeburn` CLI produces.
 */

