"Run the Gemini CLI once to sign in, then click Retry." = "运行一次 Gemini 命令行工具以登录，然后点按“重试”。";
"Sign in with the Copilot CLI or an editor Copilot plugin, then click Retry." = "通过 Copilot 命令行工具或编辑器的 Copilot 插件登录，然后点按“重试”。";
"Start the Antigravity app, then click Retry." = "启动 Antigravity 应用，然后点按“重试”。";
"Sign in with the Kimi CLI, then click Retry." = "通过 Kimi 命令行工具登录，然后点按“重试”。";
"Sign in to the Cursor app, then click Retry." = "登录 Cursor 应用，然后点按“重试”。";
"Sign in with the Pi CLI, or set ZAI_API_KEY, then click Retry." = "通过 Pi 命令行工具登录，或设置 ZAI_API_KEY，然后点按“重试”。";
"Sign in with the Grok CLI, then click Retry." = "通过 Grok 命令行工具登录，然后点按“重试”。";
"Set CLINEPASS_API_KEY, then click Retry." = "设置 CLINEPASS_API_KEY，然后点按“重试”。";
"Sign in with the provider app or CLI, then click Retry." = "通过服务商的应用或命令行工具登录，然后点按“重试”。";
"Claude quota is read from the Claude Code credentials already on this machine, then checked against Anthropic. Only the plan and the rate-limit windows come back; no conversation content is read." = "Claude 配额读取这台机器上已有的 Claude Code 凭证，然后向 Anthropic 查询。只会返回套餐和限流窗口；不会读取任何对话内容。";
"Codex quota follows the authoritative %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\auth.json session directly. Only ChatGPT-mode auth (Plus, Pro, Team, Business, Edu, Enterprise) reports rate-limit windows; API-key users are billed per request and have a different reporting surface. Credit-metered workspaces report their monthly credit allowance instead." = "Codex 配额直接沿用权威的 %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\auth.json 会话。只有 ChatGPT 模式认证（Plus / Pro / Team / Business / Edu / Enterprise）会报告限流窗口；使用 API 密钥的用户按请求计费，报告方式不同。按点数计量的工作区会改为报告其每月点数额度。";
"Gemini quota reads %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\oauth_creds.json read-only and asks Google Code Assist. Tokens stay in memory. If it shows as expired, run the Gemini CLI once to refresh your login, then click Retry." = "Gemini 配额以只读方式读取 %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\oauth_creds.json 并向 Google Code Assist 查询。令牌仅保留在内存中。若显示为已过期，请运行一次 Gemini 命令行工具刷新登录，然后点按“重试”。";
"Copilot quota reads a GitHub token that is already on this machine, read-only: the editor plugin files under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\github-copilot first, then the Copilot CLI files. Usage tracking works without any of this; only the live quota bars need a token." = "Copilot 配额以只读方式读取这台机器上已有的 GitHub 令牌：先看 %LOCALAPPDATA%\\github-copilot 下的编辑器插件文件，再看 Copilot 命令行工具的文件。用量跟踪无需这些内容，只有实时配额条才需要令牌。";
"Antigravity quota talks to the local Antigravity language server on 127.0.0.1 only. Nothing leaves the machine and no credential files are read. If it shows as disconnected, start the Antigravity app, then click Retry." = "Antigravity 配额仅通过 127.0.0.1 与本地 Antigravity 语言服务通信。没有任何数据离开这台机器，也不会读取凭证文件。若显示为未连接，请启动 Antigravity 应用，然后点按“重试”。";
"Kimi Code quota reads %USERPROFILE%\\.kimi-code\\credentials\\kimi-code.json directly. Access tokens are short-lived and only the Kimi CLI refreshes them, so if the connection shows as expired, run the Kimi CLI once and click Retry." = "Kimi Code 配额直接读取 %USERPROFILE%\\.kimi-code\\credentials\\kimi-code.json。访问令牌有效期很短，且只有 Kimi 命令行工具会刷新它们；因此若连接显示为已过期，请运行一次 Kimi 命令行工具，然后点按“重试”。";
"Cursor quota opens the Cursor editor state database read-only for its access token, then asks cursor.com. Nothing is written back, so an expired token can only be refreshed by signing in to Cursor again." = "Cursor 配额以只读方式打开 Cursor 编辑器的状态数据库以获取其访问令牌，然后向 cursor.com 查询。不会写回任何内容，因此过期的令牌只能通过重新登录 Cursor 来刷新。";
"Z.ai quota uses a supplied API key if there is one, and otherwise the Z.ai login the Pi CLI keeps in %USERPROFILE%\\.pi\\agent\\auth.json." = "Z.ai 配额优先使用提供的 API 密钥；否则使用 Pi 命令行工具保存在 %USERPROFILE%\\.pi\\agent\\auth.json 中的 Z.ai 登录信息。";
"Grok Build quota reads %USERPROFILE%\\.grok\\auth.json, preferring the current OIDC scope over an older sign-in entry." = "Grok Build 配额读取 %USERPROFILE%\\.grok\\auth.json，并优先采用当前的 OIDC 范围而非较早的登录条目。";
"ClinePass has no local login file, so the only credential is an API key." = "ClinePass 没有本地登录文件，因此唯一的凭证是 API 密钥。";
"%@ quota comes from the codeburn CLI, which reads the credential the provider's own tools left on this machine." = "%@ 配额来自 codeburn 命令行工具，它读取该服务商自己的工具留在这台机器上的凭证。";
"Choose a Claude config directory (one containing a projects folder)." = "选择一个 Claude 配置目录（其中应包含 projects 文件夹）。";
"Aggregate usage across several Claude config directories, for instance work and personal accounts. Empty tracks just the default %@. The CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIRS environment variable, when set, overrides this list." = "汇总多个 Claude 配置目录（例如工作与个人账户）的用量。留空则仅跟踪默认的 %@。如果设置了 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIRS 环境变量，它会覆盖此列表。";
"No extra directories. Tracking the default %@." = "没有额外目录，正在跟踪默认的 %@。";
"Remove %@" = "移除 %@";
"API key" = "API 密钥";
"On Windows the key is encrypted for this account with DPAPI, so the file is worthless on another machine or under another sign-in; on Linux it sits in a file only your user can read. It is passed to the codeburn CLI as an environment variable and is never written to a command line or a log." = "在 Windows 上，密钥使用 DPAPI 针对当前账户加密，因此该文件在其他机器或其他账户下毫无用处；在 Linux 上，它保存在只有你的用户能读取的文件中。密钥会作为环境变量传给 codeburn 命令行工具，绝不会写入命令行或日志。";
"A key is stored" = "已存储密钥";
"No key stored" = "未存储密钥";
"%@ quota is read with the key saved on this machine." = "使用这台机器上保存的密钥读取 %@ 配额。";
"Paste a %@ API key to read live quota." = "粘贴 %@ 的 API 密钥以读取实时配额。";
"Paste a key" = "粘贴密钥";
"Replace the stored key" = "替换已存储的密钥";
"Save and Connect" = "存储并连接";
"Providers rate-limit these endpoints per account, and one run answers for all of them, so this cadence covers every provider. Manual only refreshes when you open the popover or press Retry." = "服务商会按账户对这些接口限流，而一次运行即可回答所有服务商，因此此刷新频率适用于全部服务商。“手动”仅在你打开弹窗或点按“重试”时刷新。";
"Quota refresh cadence" = "配额刷新频率";
"Usage refresh cadence" = "用量刷新频率";
"Capacity Dock appearance" = "容量 Dock 外观";
"Capacity Dock gauge shape" = "容量 Dock 仪表形状";
"Copyright 2026 Resham Joshi (iamtoruk) - AgentSeal. MIT License." = "© 2026 Resham Joshi (iamtoruk) · AgentSeal。MIT 许可证。";
"More" = "更多";
"%lld more window not shown" = "还有 %lld 个窗口未显示";
"%lld more windows not shown" = "还有 %lld 个窗口未显示";
"CLI update needed for live quota. Run npm install -g codeburn." = "需要更新命令行工具才能获取实时配额。请运行 npm install -g codeburn。";
"Sign in with the %@ app or CLI. The dock checks again on the quota refresh cadence." = "请通过 %@ 的应用或命令行工具登录。容量 Dock 会按配额刷新频率再次检查。";
"%lld min ago" = "%lld 分钟前";
"%lld h ago" = "%lld 小时前";
"%lld d ago" = "%lld 天前";
"%@ API key" = "%@ API 密钥";
"%@ temporarily unreachable. Retrying." = "暂时无法连接 %@，正在重试。";
"Checking…" = "正在检查…";
"Connect Claude" = "连接 Claude";
"Connected providers, and anything already in the dock, appear here, so a provider can always be removed even after its connection fails." = "已连接的服务商以及已显示在 Dock 中的项目都会列在这里，因此即使某个服务商之后连接失败，也始终可以将其移除。";
"No %@ credentials found" = "未找到 %@ 凭证";
"Privacy" = "隐私";
"Reading %@ credentials..." = "正在读取 %@ 凭证…";
"Sign in with the %@ CLI first. Then click Try Again." = "请先通过 %@ 命令行工具登录，然后点按“再试一次”。";
